Error [jet.FallbackTypeMismatch]: `??` only works on a fallible value, not Int (a whole number)
  --> tests/ui/duration_in_has_no_error_path.jet:3:11
    |
  3 |     print(span.in(.Minutes) ?? 0)
    |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The left side must be a `Result` or optional value
 Fix: Call something that can fail, then write `... ?? fallback`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0405
